  "text": "## Common Mistakes (Don't Make These!)  \n❌ **Mistake 1:** Opening account without seeing original ID\n✅ **Correct:** Always verify original, then copy  \n❌ **Mistake 2:** Accepting address proof dated >3 months ago\n✅ **Correct:** Require current document within 3 months  \n❌ **Mistake 3:** Relying on verbal description instead of documentation\n✅ **Correct:** Require documentation for every verification  \n❌ **Mistake 4:** Skipping KYC because customer is \"nice\"\n✅ **Correct:** KYC applies to EVERY customer, no exceptions  \n---",
